      "id": 1,
      "text": "Long home to Japan's bulk of international trade, cosmopolitan Kobe boasts a unique history and distinct architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.japan.travel/en/destinations/kansai/hyogo/kobe-and-around/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Shin-Ōsaka Station serves as the Shinkansen terminal, with the two lines physically joined yet offering through service.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keihanshin",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "That same station links to Osaka's Umeda via the JR Kyoto Line and the subway Midōsuji Line, easing city‑wide travel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keihanshin",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Shin-Osaka Station, the busiest high‑speed station in Japan, handles millions of passengers each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keihanshin",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Major stops on the JR Osaka Loop Line include Osaka (Umeda), Tennōji, Tsuruhashi, and Kyōbashi, each a key hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keihanshin",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The name Keihanshin combines a kanji from Kyoto, Osaka, and Kobe, reflecting the region’s three‑city identity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
